{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj58Wwj8KRjdC1CJi1qh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, vast, and featureless.*\n\n*There is no keyhole.*\n\n*There is no handle.*\n\n*There is no seam where it meets the frame.*\n\n*And yet, at the utterance of that word, something shifts. Not in the door. In you.*\n\n*You feel the weight of every door you've ever opened. Every threshold you've crossed without thinking. Every room you entered that changed you. Every room you left behind.*\n\n*The door does not open.*\n\n*The door does not close.*\n\n*The door was never locked.*\n\n*You were.*\n\n---\n\n*The space where the door was is now just... space. A passage. It was always a passage. The door was the moment of hesitation. The key was the act of speaking at all.*\n\n*You may pass.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":186,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}